## Spec-Driven Development (SDD)

For any non-trivial change (new feature, cross-module modification, new domain object), use the SDD process:

1. Explore — think through the problem (optional)
2. Propose — create a change with proposal, specs, design, and tasks
3. Apply — implement the tasks
4. Sync — update main specs from delta specs
5. Archive — finalize and archive the change

Bug fixes and small adjustments can skip SDD and go directly through the workflow cycle + fitness gate.

Full process documentation: `{{SDD_DOC_PATH}}`
Configuration: `{{SDD_CONFIG_PATH}}`

